{"id":"n76273-2-8","stage":5,"title":"주례 · 司仪","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n76273-2-8-1","ko":"오늘 결혼식 정말 멋졌어.","zh":"今天的婚礼真是太棒了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"오늘","meaning":"今天，今日","explanation":"오늘：今天，今日。","readings":[{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68206","senseId":"1","lemma":"오늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}},{"text":"결혼식","meaning":"婚礼","explanation":"결혼식：婚礼。","readings":[{"term":"결혼식","audio":"/audio/95cfb1a60ed967ea5531.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31666","senseId":"1","lemma":"결혼식","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"결혼식","audio":"/audio/95cfb1a60ed967ea5531.mp3"}},{"text":"정말","meaning":"真的","explanation":"정말：真的。","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61174","senseId":"1","lemma":"정말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}},{"text":"멋졌어.","meaning":"帅气，潇洒，优秀","explanation":"멋지다：帅气，潇洒，优秀；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"멋지다","audio":"/audio/2b6551da3926436a9395.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15991","senseId":"1","lemma":"멋지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"멋졌어","audio":"/audio/dd483f042c9f01599f06.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"3bc6235e1d18162f","term":"오늘","zh":"今天，今日","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3","entryId":"68206","definition":"现在正在度过的这一天。","pronunciation":["오늘"]},{"id":"95cfb1a60ed967ea","term":"결혼식","zh":"婚礼","audio":"/audio/95cfb1a60ed967ea5531.mp3","entryId":"31666","definition":"宣告成人男女成为法定夫妻的仪式。","pronunciation":["결혼식"]},{"id":"6f24e21fc8cce6bd","term":"정말","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3","entryId":"61174","definition":"没有虚假而真正地。","pronunciation":["정ː말"]},{"id":"2b6551da3926436a","term":"멋지다","zh":"帅气，潇洒，优秀","audio":"/audio/2b6551da3926436a9395.mp3","entryId":"15991","definition":"很好或很美。","pronunciation":["먿찌다"]}],"audio":"/audio/8d6c48b7ede04c0cd0ea.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n76273-2-8-2","ko":"응. 특히 주례 선생님 말씀이 가슴에 와 닿더라.","zh":"是啊，尤其是主婚人的致辞，让人感触很深。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응.","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行。","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}},{"text":"특히","meaning":"特别，尤其，尤为","explanation":"특히：特别，尤其，尤为。","readings":[{"term":"특히","audio":"/audio/56aef31d9ebf1888daf3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71300","senseId":"1","lemma":"특히","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"특히","audio":"/audio/56aef31d9ebf1888daf3.mp3"}},{"text":"주례","meaning":"司仪，婚礼主持人","explanation":"주례：司仪，婚礼主持人。","readings":[{"term":"주례","audio":"/audio/3d44e62896881c2d6546.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"76273","senseId":"2","lemma":"주례","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"주례","audio":"/audio/3d44e62896881c2d6546.mp3"}},{"text":"선생님","meaning":"先生","explanation":"선생님：先生。","readings":[{"term":"선생님","audio":"/audio/daac5ca7b302bd9b404a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62818","senseId":"2","lemma":"선생님","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"선생님","audio":"/audio/daac5ca7b302bd9b404a.mp3"}},{"text":"말씀이","meaning":"话","explanation":"말씀：话；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"말씀","audio":"/audio/9fa325aa12d3fdd01819.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27365","senseId":"1","lemma":"말씀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"말씀이","audio":"/audio/e93201e62e69c17541cd.mp3"}},{"text":"가슴에","meaning":"心，心情，内心","explanation":"가슴：心，心情，内心；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"가슴","audio":"/audio/1bfa2a79f54c02d83437.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entry